WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,840
Your Majesty is ready to punish you

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,840
But it's temporarily blocked

3
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:06,840
Impossible

4
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:09,840
The emperor doesn't punish me because of my father

5
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:13,190
You thought you would be fooled

6
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:16,290
How to say this

7
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:17,290
Very simple

8
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:19,290
My father wanted to share the emperor's worries

9
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:21,290
Received a fire that could never be guaranteed

10
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:23,290
As long as I don't rebel

11
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:25,290
Even the emperor will not embarrass me

12
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:27,290
And that old guy Yongpinghou

13
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:29,290
It will definitely rely on the emperor not knowing the situation outside.

14
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:30,290
blackmail

15
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:31,290
And my sun was shining early in the morning

16
00:00:31,290 --> 00:00:33,290
The emperor will know as soon as he checks

17
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:39,360
Please let yourself be taken advantage of by this prodigal son.

18
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:41,940
Besides, that old dog is an elder

19
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,940
Tell me a junior

20
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:45,940
On this point he was at a disadvantage.

21
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:47,940
Then the emperor will ask the truth

22
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:49,940
Then thank the old dog for being so deceptive

23
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:50,940
No dismissal from office

24
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:52,940
I'll have to get a few sticks, too.
